    "custom_liquid_DDicKx": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .reviews-section {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 50px 0;\n  }\n\n  .reviews-section h2 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .reviews-carousel {\n    display: flex;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n    gap: 20px;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .reviews-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .review-card {\n    flex: 0 0 300px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    text-align: left;\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n  }\n\n  .review-card .stars {\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .review-card .stars img {\n    width: 150px; /* Bigger Trustpilot logo */\n    height: auto;\n  }\n\n  .review-card p {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .review-card h4 {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 8px 0 5px;\n  }\n\n  .review-card span {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-controls {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-arrow {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 14px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.3s;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-arrow:hover {\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-arrow svg {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    stroke-width: 2.2;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"reviews-section\">\n  <h2>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot\" style=\"height:105px;\">\n    +10,000 Verified Reviews \n  </h2>\n\n  <div class=\"reviews-carousel\" id=\"reviewsTrack\">\n    \n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Absolutely love these lamps! They give my living room such a cosy, warm glow.”</p>\n      <h4>Emma Johnson <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Very elegant design. Everyone who visits my home asks where I got them.”</p>\n      <h4>Michael Smith <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Stylish, portable, and easy to use. I bought two and plan to get more.”</p>\n      <h4>Charlotte Brown <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“These lamps completely changed the atmosphere in my bedroom. Worth it!”</p>\n      <h4>Daniel Miller <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Soft warm light, perfect for relaxing evenings. Highly recommend.”</p>\n      <h4>Olivia Taylor <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Great lamps, very chic. I just wish they were a little taller.”</p>\n      <h4>Christopher Wilson <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Adds a calming vibe. I use one on my desk for late-night work.”</p>\n      <h4>Sophie Davis <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“I love that they’re cordless—no messy wires, just simple elegance.”</p>\n      <h4>James Anderson <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“They look even better in person than online. So modern and chic!”</p>\n      <h4>Amelia Thomas <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Perfect addition to my dining area. Creates a restaurant-like atmosphere.”</p>\n      <h4>Ethan White <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Placed one in my hallway—great soft light at night without being harsh.”</p>\n      <h4>Grace Harris <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Really good value. The glow is beautiful and the charge lasts long.”</p>\n      <h4>Benjamin Martin <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“My kids love them! They make bedtime stories extra cosy.”</p>\n      <h4>Lucy Evans <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Lovely lamps, but delivery was a bit slower than expected.”</p>\n      <h4>Matthew Thompson <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Perfect for setting the mood during movie nights at home.”</p>\n      <h4>Isla Robinson <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Bought three for my office—clients always comment on them.”</p>\n      <h4>William Clark <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“I’m obsessed with the design. They look like art pieces, not just lights.”</p>\n      <h4>Jessica Lewis <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Battery life is excellent. I use mine daily and barely recharge.”</p>\n      <h4>Andrew Walker <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Love how versatile they are. I move them around depending on my mood.”</p>\n      <h4>Poppy Hall <span>— Verified Purchaser (UK)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0738/6035/0101/files/trustpilot-stars-logo-png_seeklogo-477110.png?v=1756656806\" alt=\"Trustpilot stars\">\n      </div>\n      <p>“Elegant, warm, and unique. Easily my best home décor purchase this year.”</p>\n      <h4>Jack Allen <span>— Verified Purchaser (US)</span></h4>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"carousel-controls\">\n    <button class=\"carousel-arrow\" onclick=\"scrollReviews(-1)\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" /></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"carousel-arrow\" onclick=\"scrollReviews(1)\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" /></svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function scrollReviews(direction) {\n    const track = document.getElementById(\"reviewsTrack\");\n    const cardWidth = track.children[0].offsetWidth + 20;\n    track.scrollBy({ left: direction * cardWidth, behavior: 'smooth' });\n  }\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "multicolumn_FHkHdg": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_ngtLVN": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Testimonial_Image1_3.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>The Perfect Nightlights</h3><p>These are great night lights. Love that they offer a dimmer slide on them to control brightness and they look very nice throughout our home. The color is very nice, the size is perfect and they aren't heavy in weight, but don't feel cheap at all. The price point is perfect.<br/>We have had them for a few weeks and they seem very durable and function quite well in our main living room and hallways.<br/>We have had nightlights since our 11 year old was just a baby and now that she is almost a teen, the sophisticated look that these provide are great and still serve the purpose they were created for, to provide light. We love having them for sleepovers for her friends, so no one is stumbling around in the dark looking for the bathroom or the stairs. Highly recommend.</p><p><strong>- Jacob C.</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_XEJ9wK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Testimonial_Image2_3.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>Nice Upgrade for Decor Lighting</h3><p>I like how I can change the strength of the light. Good for bathrooms, kitchens, etc. sometimes you just don’t want bright light when walking into the bathroom and this can give you a good lighting that doesn’t hurt your eyes.</p><p><strong>- Shirley R.</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_n6BUk7": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Testimonial_Image3_3.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>Home Elevation - Check!</h3><p>I am in LOVE with these nightlights! I have purchased 6 in total. I love the ‘spotlight’ look and how they nicely light up the hallway, bathroom, and kitchen for when anyone needs to get up at night. I love the dimming feature. I wish I could make them a bit warmer, but love them nonetheless! I love how they automatically turn on when it gets dark/dim. My sons all love them too. The price is amazing! The size doesn’t prevent you from plugging in something else into the outlet which is so great! Highly recommend!</p><p><strong>- Mary H.</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
