          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Warmth and Cosiness Your Way</strong></p><p>The adjustable LED lighting of the <strong>GlowCage™ Lamp</strong> makes it easy to set the mood to match your feeling.</p><p>Choose soft, warm light to relax or a brighter setting for functional tasks. You’re in control of how you want to experience your space.</p>",
            "text_style": "subtitle"
          }
        }
