          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The modern, minimalist design of the <strong>GlowCage™ Lamp</strong> adds a touch of elegance to any space.</p><p>Without bothersome cables, you can place this stylish lamp anywhere – from your dining room to your bedside table.</p><p>The lamp blends seamlessly into any interior and instantly catches the eye as a true statement piece.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
