        "text_mAwW8T": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p></p><p>With its long battery life, the <strong>GlowCage™ Lamp</strong> provides uninterrupted lighting – perfect for long evenings or spontaneous moments.</p><p>Thanks to the wireless design, you can easily move the lamp anywhere you like, so you can always enjoy the ultimate cosiness. Luxury and convenience in one!</p>",
